  "details": "Even without a microphone attached, toggling the Face Mirror flashes activity on the microphone icon in the bottom left HUD when it shouldn't. It did not flash in a previous Build `1902`.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Set Mic Icon Position to \"Bottom Left\" or \"Both\" in the settings.\n\n2. Set Mic Icon Visibility to \"On Activity\" or \"When Muted\" (while muted).\n\n3. (Optional) Disconnect any microphones from the system.\n\n4. Press F4 or open the Face Mirror from the Action Menu.\n\nExpected result: The microphone icon should not flash activity on the HUD when toggling the face mirror.\n\nActual result: The microphone icon flashes activity on the HUD when toggling the face mirror in Build `1919` or later.\n\nAdditional info: For comparison, toggling toggling the personal mirror or pressing the F5 key on keyboard for third-person mode does not flash the microphone activity on HUD.",
